      "content": "# The dsh-ui-subagent-monitor bundle layer: applied when a profile lists this\n# package as a bundle (dsh plugin add ...). Rows insert into the composed\n# configuration; later layers may override them by id.\n- insert:\n    - id: ui-subagent-monitor\n      name: '@leetoners/dsh-ui-subagent-monitor'\n"
